==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''42 Million Downloads'''}} for The Battle Cats! Another milestone on the Cat Army's march across the universe!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between April 15th (11:00am) and April 29th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Special Celebration'''}}<br>
April 15th (11am) thru April 18th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
April 18th (11am) thru April 20th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
April 20th (11am) thru April 22nd (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
April 22nd (11am) thru April 24th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
April 24th (11am) thru April 26th (11am)<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Event All-Stars: Grand Jubilee!'''}}<br>
April 26th (11am) thru April 29th (11am)

Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days (4/16, 4/18, 4/20, 4/22, 4/24, 4/26, 4/28)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days (4/17, 4/19, 4/21, 4/23, 4/25, 4/27, 4/29)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''4/17, 4/20, 4/23, 4/26 and 4/29'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
April 15th (11:00am) thru April 22nd (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
April 22nd (11:00am) thru April 29th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catfruit Capsules'''}}<br>
April 15th (11:00am) through April 22nd (10:59am)<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''・Catseye Capsules'''}}<br>
April 22nd (11:00am) through April 29th (2:59pm)<br>
<small><small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

